content_text:
To my surprise, I couldn’t find the amazing Chivo /Emmanuel Lubeszki (
https://www.instagram.com/chivexp/?hl=en
) on our podcast! Likely because he is very busy! Can we get him somehow please?
And when we do that, can we also have
@dmullenasc
join in? Yes, I will keep asking for more
@dmullenasc
participation in the podcast, in whatever form. I won’t stop! 🙂

